  <item>
    <title>世界或许不会变更好，但我们会</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/686ad49a93fd2d72b8d5af5c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">686ad49a93fd2d72b8d5af5c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Jul 2025 21:19:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见 听友们！惭愧对手指 (＞人＜；)</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们突然带来了</span><strong><span>年终（中）总结</span></strong><span>——凭实力发布全网最迟2024回顾特辑——还会有人愿意听吗？（尽管无人在意也依然任性更新！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>你会听到关于</span><strong><span>职业转轨</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>艺术创作</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>性骚扰维权</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>德国留子体验</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>西班牙旅行</span></strong><span>、</span><strong><span>读书会组织</span></strong><span>等等丰富多彩（杂七杂八）的生活碎片~总之是我们舍不得私藏的一次对话！</span></p><span></span><p><span>节目录制于2024年末/2025年初，初剪完成约摸是今年早春，此刻在盛夏的蝉鸣里重听已然感到些许陌生，时间的流逝经由声音变得具象了起来。三次元生活忙忙碌碌的主播们有在好好生活，但也很想念小宇宙里的大家！如果你还在的话，欢迎留言say hi 以及鞭策我们！</span></p><span></span><p><span>2025下半年祝大家健康顺遂哦！那我们很快下期再见啦~🍀</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>对了！结尾有彩蛋哦——是新鲜的2025年中总结！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="227">03:47</a> &nbsp;2024年底状态check</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1086">18:06</a> &nbsp;完美快乐瞬间</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">33:51</a> &nbsp;自我突破时刻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2816">46:56</a> &nbsp;落泪/遗憾体验</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3276">54:36</a> &nbsp;与女性主义相关的经历</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3894">64:54</a> &nbsp;对2025年的展望</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4225">70:25</a> &nbsp;彩蛋：2025年上半年汇报</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期提及：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>📍由公厕改造而成的柏林艺术空间 </span><a href="https://kunstbruecke-am-wildenbruch.de/en" data-url="https://kunstbruecke-am-wildenbruch.de/en"><span>Kunstbrücke am Wildenbruch</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📍巴塞罗那落日观景地</span><a href="http://www.bunkers.cat/en/" data-url="http://www.bunkers.cat/en/"><span>卡梅尔碉堡</span></a><span>（Bunkers del Carmel，又被称作“焦糖山”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>📍巴塞罗那小酒馆 </span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/lapepitabarcelona/?hl=en" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/lapepitabarcelona/?hl=en"><span>La Pepita</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🏛️德国美术馆通过女性主义视角重新审视馆藏的相关展览：</span><br><span>①柏林旧博物馆（Altes Museum）</span><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.smb.museum/en/museums-institutions/altes-museum/exhibitions/detail/goddesses-and-consorts/" data-url="https://www.smb.museum/en/museums-institutions/altes-museum/exhibitions/detail/goddesses-and-consorts/"><span>女神与侍伴：古代神话中的女性（Goddesses and Consorts Women in Ancient Myth）</span></a><br><span>②博德博物馆 （Bode-Museum）</span><br><span> </span><a href="https://www.smb.museum/en/museums-institutions/bode-museum/exhibitions/the-second-glance/women/" data-url="https://www.smb.museum/en/museums-institutions/bode-museum/exhibitions/the-second-glance/women/"><span>展览系列 第二眼：女性 （Exhibition series: The Second Glance Woman）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🎬2024年末令主播们上头的狗血韩剧</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36810718/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/36810718/"><span>《现在拨打的电话》</span></a><span>（久违地磕到了BG）</span></p><span></span><p><span>📖秋秋组织的「柏林公寓读书会」2024书单：</span><br><span> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26417301/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26417301/"><span>《最后的天空之后：巴勒斯坦人的生活》</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/5381705/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/5381705/"><span>《柏林童年》</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35680099/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35680099/"><span>《偶像失格》</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/26916012/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/26916012/"><span>《黑暗的左手》</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/27593378/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/27593378/"><span>《少年来了》</span></a><br><span> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36437522/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36437522/"><span>《大奥》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>🗣️秋秋的公共讲演：</span><br><span>香港 M+：</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EAZICQb-KoQ" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EAZICQb-KoQ"><span>www.youtube.com</span></a><br><span>巴黎 蓬皮杜艺术中心：</span><a href="https://www.theartjournal.cn/archives/news/136205" data-url="https://www.theartjournal.cn/archives/news/136205"><span>www.theartjournal.cn</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>📢 特别宣传位：</span><br><span>乔乔的作品夏季在展：</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RCdqsLYQJDvQQxuw28hwGw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/RCdqsLYQJDvQQxuw28hwGw"><span>河北博物院</span></a><br><span>乔乔制作的游戏</span><a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/2837740/Floatineer/" data-url="https://store.steampowered.com/app/2837740/Floatineer/"><span>《Floatineer》</span></a><span>（demo）</span><br><span>乔乔的audio-visual演出预告：</span><a href="https://www.instagram.com/p/DLxJ-poSJxy/?img_index=3&amp;igsh=MXRnczgzOXNwYzViYg==" data-url="https://www.instagram.com/p/DLxJ-poSJxy/?img_index=3&amp;igsh=MXRnczgzOXNwYzViYg=="><span>“ 家出 run away! from home! “</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>💬</span><br><span>主播｜乔乔 &amp; 秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>💻</span><br><span>后期｜乔乔 &amp; 秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵 </span><br><span>細野晴臣 – 終わりの季節</span><br><span>陈珊妮 – 成为一个厉害的普通人</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐎 </span><strong><span>加入社群</span></strong><br><span>添加微信小助手【clipclop2022】即可进群</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 </span><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong><br><span>欢迎你给我们来信：zmgh2024@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
