  <item>
    <title>捕捉心动与手足温情，综艺也能拍出文学性｜恋爱兄妹</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67993d16d74435e4a340b836</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67993d16d74435e4a340b836</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Jan 2025 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025年的第一期节目来啦！首先祝听友们新年快乐，万事顺意，蛇年大吉🐍~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我们和第一位返场嘉宾 梦妮 一起聊了2024年令我们印象深刻的韩国综艺《恋爱兄妹》。这档融合了亲情、友情、爱情的节目被称为恋爱综艺版的《请回答1988》——不仅呈现了丰满的故事线与细腻的情感，还散发出一种古早「家庭录像带」般的“梦核”氛围感，让人欲罢不能。</span></p><span></span><p><span>虽然节目结束（且录制本期播客）已有一段日子了，我们至今还是偶尔会在社媒上瞅一瞅其中几位电子家人的生活现状，好综艺的余韵果然悠长！总是蹭不上热点的「走马观花」决定从《恋爱兄妹》开启「综艺罐头」系列，一起细品这些不易过期的精品综艺~</span></p><span></span><p><span>*「综艺罐头」系列下期预告：《思想验证区域 The Community》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="833">13:53</a> 喜爱的名场面分享：世承接父母电话、看相册和读信、公开家庭影像、正燮面试、江原道三“姐妹”、真心话修罗场</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2561">42:41</a> 关于李龙宇：阿尔法男的枷锁</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2959">49:19</a> 从相亲节目到恋综 看别人恋爱为什么有趣</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4138">68:58</a> 恋综中折射出的当代恋爱范式</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4491">74:51</a> PD将男嘉宾作为主线的嫌疑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4808">80:08</a> 乔乔的手足体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎬 涉及影视作品</span><br><span>B站：安琸 </span><a href="https://b23.tv/lYYEfh5" data-url="https://b23.tv/lYYEfh5"><span>【教科书级别的回避和焦虑的隔空拉扯。【恋爱兄妹】龙宇x初雅】</span></a><br><span>综艺：</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/movie/36234464?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/movie/36234464?dt_dapp=1"><span>《辣妈庄园》（2023）</span></a><br><span>综艺：</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30312196/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30312196/"><span>《胜负之夏 老师!学习和恋爱都请教给我吧》（2018）</span></a><br><span>综艺：《蹦蹦地球游戏厅》（梦妮提及的珍爱名场面）</span><a href="https://b23.tv/c9c0jJ5" data-url="https://b23.tv/c9c0jJ5"><span>【谢谢你们很诚实 虽然一直良心告白 让游戏延长了2小时】</span></a><span> </span><br><span>电影：</span><a href="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/movie/1296339?dt_dapp=1" data-url="https://www.douban.com/doubanapp/dispatch/movie/1296339?dt_dapp=1"><span>《爱在黎明破晓前》（1995）</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>💬</span><br><span>嘉宾｜梦妮，资深韩综爱好者</span><br><span>主播｜乔乔 &amp; 秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>💻</span><br><span>后期｜乔乔 &amp; 秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵</span><br><span>Leebada – 우리 둘만의 혁명</span><br><span>박소은 – 위로 (To us)</span><br><span>曺薇娟 – You and I</span><br><span>BamBam – riBBon</span><br><span>GUM TAPES – Shine and Glitter</span><br><span>Hen – 나만 보이는 이별은 (Invisible Goodbye)</span><br><span>金范洙 – 나타나</span><br><span>朴宰亨 &amp; 朴世承 – 二十五二十一</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐎 加入社群</span><br><span>添加微信小助手【clipclop2022】即可进群</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 联系我们</span><br><span>欢迎你给我们来信：</span><br><span>zmgh2024@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6368e809e3f35162c68b8cf6/ljgK1Z167sWvtRTqcI1NW4jGs7SN.m4a" length="131506497" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:30:36</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl6QPqMPuLpy0hZEpypXAhtXAleg.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>便利贴妈咪与死小孩霸总｜解剖恋爱脑3：命中注定我爱你</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66b8c67f33591c27be4c877e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66b8c67f33591c27be4c877e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 11 Aug 2024 14:11:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，甚是想念！我们带着「</span><strong><span>解剖恋爱脑</span></strong><span>」系列回归啦！</span></p><p><span>本期邀请到好友绯绯，一起热聊台湾偶像剧史上单集平均收视率纪录保持者——《</span><strong><span>命中注定我爱你</span></strong><span>》（2008）。这部由陈乔恩、阮经天主演的经典偶像剧可谓集齐了 </span><strong><span>王子与灰姑娘、先婚后爱、契约婚姻、破镜重圆、追妻火葬场</span></strong><span> 等无数狗血元素，又突破性地将车祸流产的血腥「虐女」现场直观呈现，给万千观众留下了深刻印象。</span></p><p><span>在十六年后的当下重温，令人不适的地方也几乎和老梗一样密集：对生育「小金曾孙」和「传承」的狂热；对幼稚男主纪存希的宽容和美化；对事业型女二石安娜的规训与惩罚；把对吗喽Anson的无情差遣当做笑料……</span></p><p><span>欣怡似乎比杉菜少了一些个性锋芒，比湘琴又缺了一些钝感愚勇，这样一个善良、利他、缺乏自信的女孩要如何立足于世？在「大女主」光芒万丈的今天，「便利贴女孩」将何去何从？从《命中注定我爱你》延展开去，我们也聊了聊「虐女」情节及其细分类型、女性主体性及创造力与母职之间的残酷角力。</span></p><p><span>如果你喜欢「解剖恋爱脑」系列，请一定要多多留言，告诉我们你期待「解剖」的下一部剧吧！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> &nbsp;对小朋友来说很刺激的题材</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="702">11:42</a> &nbsp;名场面：雨中车祸流产、鸡情天使庆生、姜王庙婚礼、上海重逢闹剧、丈母娘捅涌泉穴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2430">40:30</a> &nbsp;照护者欣怡和巨婴存希之间的平衡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3358">55:58</a> &nbsp;男二Dylan发掘璞玉的癖好</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3524">58:44</a> &nbsp;女二Anna心疼男人就是倒霉的开始</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4032">67:12</a> &nbsp;片末彩蛋里的恐怖故事</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4216">70:16</a> &nbsp;欣怡成为“独立女性”Elaine</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4415">73:35</a> &nbsp;艺术家身份与母职的冲突</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5229">87:09</a> &nbsp;厚黑奶奶、刀子嘴妈妈、打工人Anson</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5854">97:34</a> &nbsp;追妻火葬场与虐女</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7082">118:02</a> 极端利他和沉睡的主体性</span></p><p><span>📚</span><strong><span> 涉及书籍</span></strong><br><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/35032242/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/35032242/"><span>《阅读浪漫小说：女性，父权制和通俗文学》</span></a><br><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36392325/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36392325/"><span>《逃生梯上的婴儿：创造力与母性的两难》</span></a><br><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36480207/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36480207/"><span>《重塑爱情：如何摆脱父权制对两性关系的影响》</span></a></p><p><span>🎬</span><strong><span> 涉及影视作品</span></strong><br><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25812730/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25812730/"><span>《如懿传》</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25812420/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25812420/"><span>《花千骨》</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25823280/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/25823280/"><span>《东宫》</span></a><br><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hf421z7gF/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1hf421z7gF/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click"><span>The Hollywood Reporter Full Drama Actress Roundtable</span></a></p><p><span>💬</span><br><span>嘉宾｜绯绯，资深台偶专家</span><br><span>主播｜乔乔 &amp; 秋秋</span></p><p><span>💻</span><br><span>后期｜乔乔 &amp; 秋秋</span></p><p><span>🎵</span><br><span>元若蓝 – 99次我爱他</span><br><span>命中注定我爱你OST – 心愿便利贴</span><br><span>锦绣二重唱 – 我的快乐</span></p><p><span>🐎 </span><strong><span>加入社群</span></strong><br><span>添加微信小助手【clipclop2022】即可进群</span></p><p><span>📮 </span><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong><br><span>欢迎你给我们来信：zmgh2024@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
