  <item>
    <title>那些唤醒了我们的女性主义书籍｜串台「普通读者」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66102e7dc891c06e737a1a05</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66102e7dc891c06e737a1a05</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 06 Apr 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>走马观花第一次串台啦！我们和「</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f8a3a9783c34e85ddec0dfb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5f8a3a9783c34e85ddec0dfb"><strong><span>普通读者</span></strong></a><span>」的主播 </span><strong><span>堂本</span></strong><span> 连线，聊了聊在成长为女性主义者的道路上遇到的那些宝藏书籍。</span></p><span></span><p><span>乔乔介绍了高中时期具有女性主义启蒙意义的经典读物，堂本带来了有助于大家快乐实践马克思主义女权主义的指南，秋秋介绍了离散在海外的中国女性艺术家的自我书写。</span></p><span></span><p><span>现实中，《我的节育奋斗史》出版近一个世纪后，女性依然在为生育选择权抗争；《对话》中，中国女性艺术家作品的阐释权被父权社会夺走之后的35年，在北京大学的礼堂内，父权代言人们仍旧堂而皇之地霸占着女性创作者的言说空间；《大笨蛋反叛手册》出版了近十年，在世界经历了疫情的蹂躏后，“当街吃火锅”还是可能的么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>不过，即使现状看上去令人沮丧，我们还是愿意从身边的联结开始做起——或许与志同道合的节目串台就是我们迈出的一小步！也欢迎大家发来联结信号～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/4247906/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/4247906/"><span>《我的节育奋斗史》</span></a><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36326958/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36326958/"><span>《避孕简史》</span></a><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="993">16:33</a> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/24827120/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/24827120/"><span>《爽：七十年代私人札记》</span></a><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36503056/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36503056/"><span>《为了99%民众的女性主义》</span></a><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2003">33:23</a> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/27591873/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/27591873/"><span>《世界大笨蛋反叛手册》</span></a><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/10494025/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/10494025/"><span>《素人之乱》</span></a><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2329">38:49</a> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/27069577/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/27069577/"><span>《他们眼望上苍》</span></a><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2833">47:13</a> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/11577236/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/11577236/"><span>《对话》</span></a><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3664">61:04</a> </span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36283104/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36283104/"><span>《They Call It Love: The Politics of Emotional Life》</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>其他提及：</span><br><span>📝 </span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sl74MCo1NkGMbSrjzLlKWQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/sl74MCo1NkGMbSrjzLlKWQ"><span>缴蕊《生育选择与近年来欧美电影中女性主义的新发展》</span></a><br><span>📖</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36374149/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36374149/"><span>《凯列班与女巫：妇女、身体与原始积累》</span></a><br><span>📖</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/24753751/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/24753751/"><span>《向前一步：女性，工作及领导意志</span></a><span>》</span><br><span>📖</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/27167417/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/27167417/"><span>《妇女的力量与社会翻转》</span></a><br><span>📖</span><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/36721065/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/36721065/"><span>《A Short History of Trans Misogyny》</span></a><br><span>🎬</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30325822/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/30325822/"><span>《推翻罗诉韦德案》</span></a><br><span>🎬</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35633650/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/35633650/"><span>《坠落的审判》</span></a><br><span>🎬</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/4058939/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/4058939/"><span>《芭比》</span></a><br><span>🎬</span><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/10604086/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/10604086/"><span>《封神》</span></a><br><span>🎬</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2ovV47QWrDM" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2ovV47QWrDM"><span>《素人之乱》</span></a><span>YouTube</span><br><span>🎬</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hY9hwsctgrM" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hY9hwsctgrM"><span>《七宗罪——89中国现代艺术展上的七个行为》</span></a><span>YouTube</span><br><span>🎬</span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R-0jMDcakw8" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R-0jMDcakw8"><span>《流浪北京》</span></a><span>YouTube</span><br><span>🔗</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yz4y1V7jN/?buvid=Z14EA31B14967F9746D2A48E64E755587FE9&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=pNp6SPYyepZNqKuoK1PB2A%3D%3D&amp;p=1&amp;plat_id=114&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=315079EF-C922-408C-96F2-519C5E95975A&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;spmid=united.player-video-detail.0.0&amp;timestamp=1712325475&amp;unique_k=3d67KGV&amp;up_id=197482" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Yz4y1V7jN/?buvid=Z14EA31B14967F9746D2A48E64E755587FE9&amp;is_story_h5=false&amp;mid=pNp6SPYyepZNqKuoK1PB2A%3D%3D&amp;p=1&amp;plat_id=114&amp;share_from=ugc&amp;share_medium=iphone&amp;share_plat=ios&amp;share_session_id=315079EF-C922-408C-96F2-519C5E95975A&amp;share_source=WEIXIN&amp;share_tag=s_i&amp;spmid=united.player-video-detail.0.0&amp;timestamp=1712325475&amp;unique_k=3d67KGV&amp;up_id=197482"><span>封神，男人与马（I’m Just Ken）</span></a><span> B站混剪</span><br><span>🔗</span><a href="https://www.womenonwaves.org/en/" data-url="https://www.womenonwaves.org/en/"><span>Women on Waves</span></a><span>（波浪上的女人）</span><br><span>🔗</span><a href="https://ocw.aca.ntu.edu.tw/ntu-ocw/ocw/cou/101S120" data-url="https://ocw.aca.ntu.edu.tw/ntu-ocw/ocw/cou/101S120"><span>欧丽娟《红楼梦》公开课</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>💬</span><br><span>嘉宾｜堂本，「普通读者」主播</span><br><span>主播｜乔乔 &amp; 秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>💻</span><br><span>后期｜乔乔</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵</span><br><span>大象体操 – 阵雨</span><br><span>John Bartman - Happy African Village (Music from Pixabay)</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐎 </span><strong><span>加入社群</span></strong><br><span>添加微信小助手【clipclop2022】即可进群</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 </span><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong><br><span>欢迎你给我们来信：zmgh2024@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
