  <item>
    <title>故土还是他乡？迁徙的她们和我们｜过往人生 &amp; 布鲁克林</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65fc09451519139e4fbf3c83</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65fc09451519139e4fbf3c83</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 21 Mar 2024 10:17:40 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期我们藉由电影</span><strong><span>《过往人生》、《布鲁克林》</span></strong><span>与定居在纽约布鲁克林的老朋友阿水聊了聊有关「迁徙」的话题——以影片中的两位女主人公为镜，分享各自漂泊异乡的生命经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>**节目内容涉及剧透，请酌情收听**</span></p><span></span><p><span>有关「迁徙」的记忆里浸染着少女时期的懵懂与苦涩，伴随着令人自豪的蜕变与成长、也饱含失落的遗憾和无措的彷徨。在「迁徙」中相遇或错过的人与事，一次次的抉择与取舍，极大程度上塑造了此时此刻复杂的你我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>人并不能选择出生地，却似乎被给予了一定的自由去寻找自己想要扎根的「新家园」。然而这一点流动的自由既奢侈也脆弱，寻找「新家园」的路途诱人也荆棘丛生。离开亦或留下，并没有什么是正确答案。能在这「迁徙」之路上与彼此相识，何其有缘有幸🚢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="588">09:48</a> 阿水的同款过往人生</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="855">14:15</a> 移民的经历让自己变得有主见</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 网络社交媒体串联起的回忆</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 初来乍到时的紧张和窘迫</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2524">42:04</a> 对帅气前辈女性移民的憧憬和敬佩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a> “壮士断腕”的勇气</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3122">52:02</a> 东亚女性的“自卷精神”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> 独自漂浮状态下的不安感</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3654">60:54</a> 家乡小城的温情与桎梏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4249">70:49</a>《布鲁克林》原著与电影的不同</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4721">78:41</a> 我们为何迁徙</span></p><span></span><p><span>提及的文艺作品：</span><br><span>🎬《过往人生》（2023）</span><br><span>🎬《布鲁克林》（2015）</span><br><span>📖《布鲁克林》[爱尔兰] 科尔姆·托宾</span><br><span>📖《远海》[韩] 孔枝泳</span><br><span>📖《多谢不阅》[荷] 杜布拉夫卡·乌格雷西奇</span><br><span>🎮《开箱整理 Unpacking》Witch Beam</span><br><span>*你也可以在我们的</span><strong><span>Notion主页</span></strong><span>上查看上述推荐：</span><a href="https://stitch-brain-42b.notion.site/ClipClop-a62be59b8cbd40a6805682f204a523dc" data-url="https://stitch-brain-42b.notion.site/ClipClop-a62be59b8cbd40a6805682f204a523dc"><span>stitch-brain-42b.notion.site</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>💬</span><br><span>嘉宾｜阿水，🍠 @布鲁克林王祖贤</span><br><span>主播｜乔乔 &amp; 秋秋</span></p><span></span><p><span>💻</span><br><span>后期｜乔乔</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵</span><br><span>Frank Sinatra - Theme From New York, New York</span><br><span>Christopher Bear &amp; Daniel Rossen -《过往人生》OST</span><br><span>Michael Brook -《布鲁克林》OST</span><br><span>Madonna - Vogue</span><br><span>Jeff van Dyck - Unpacking Theme</span><br><span>Christopher Bear &amp; Daniel Rossen - See You</span></p><span></span><p><span>🐎 </span><strong><span>加入社群</span></strong><br><span>添加微信小助手【clipclop2022】即可进群</span></p><span></span><p><span>📮 </span><strong><span>联系我们</span></strong><br><span>欢迎你给我们来信：zmgh2024@gmail.com</span></p>]]></description>
